  "prefLabel": "Lab 1508.02 Commensurate Fines",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1508.02 Commensurate Fines. Any fines for violations of the labor laws of this state shall be assessed either against the employee company or the client company based upon the commensurate level of control of the worksite and each leasing party’s responsibility for compliance with the applicable violation.\n\nSource. #10221, eff 11-3-12; ss by #13440, eff 8-24-22",
